name=del
category=files
description=remove files and directories
usage=del [-r|--recursive] <file|directory>...
option=-r, --recursive    remove a directory tree; without it only empty directories are removed
option=-h, --help    show this help
note=Targets run in order; failures do not stop later targets.
note=Duplicates and targets already removed by an earlier recursive operand fail explicitly.
note=When run from Shoot, unquoted pathname patterns expand before del starts; unmatched patterns stay literal and hidden names require an explicit leading dot.
note=Use -- before a target beginning with a hyphen.
